// main.cpp — FluentUI card-based gallery demo.
//
// A single-window showcase of all controls organized into themed cards. The window
// is a borderless Mica backdrop with a custom title bar and status bar. Content is
// a ScrollPanel → StackPanel with five sections, each holding a 2-column grid of
// cards (except Dialogs, which is 1-column so buttons fit).
//
// Cards follow the Win11 design: rounded corners, translucent fill, subtle stroke.
// Every control is labeled and interactive where it makes sense. Dialogs demonstrate
// both ContentDialog/MessageDialog and a custom DialogWindow, all centered on the
// owner window (Issue #3 fix verification).

